Module
  name: game_telegraph
  description: Floor telegraphs (O549) - boss attacks mark the floor: a flat translucent orange fill on every tile of the attack area and a bright line round the whole area, under the creatures; the server sends the area on the monster bar's extended opcode 125 (game_monsterbar hands the actions floor and floorclear over) and leaves the sprite pulses to clients that did not say hello
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ telegraph_logic, telegraph ]
  dependencies:
    - game_interface
    - game_monsterbar
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1007
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
